window.products.push({"id":966095,"name":"Boska Holland Cheese Slicer Herve","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51RpNP-9XmL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Boska Holland was founded over 100 years ago in Bode graven near Gouda, home of the original Gouda cheese. The family-owned business developed throughout four generations from forge, hardware store and tool supplier into the present company, specializing in quality cheese tools. Boska Holland now carries the widest variety of cheese cutting equipment in the world.There's nothing like freshly sliced cheese. As with wine, the taste of cheese improves when it comes into contact with oxygen. This super sharp cheese slicer is a product of exceptional class, is handmade and was specially developed with world-famous French affineur Herve Mons. A must-have for the true cheese aficionado who appreciates quality and design. It's sophisticated design allows you to create perfect, thin slices with less force. By applying micro perforation to the blade in a very specific pattern, the cheese slicer becomes non-stick. When slicing the cheese, either young or old, it won't stick to the blade and won't curl up and break. Wash this cheese knife with care; wash it by hand in warm, soapy water, not in the dishwasher. This super slicer comes with a lifetime warranty. Curious? Take a look at the other knives in the Herve Mons collection! Herve Mons is the enthusiastic manager of French family company Maison Mons, which has specialized in the ripening of exceptional cheeses since 1964. Herve was awarded the Meilleur Ouvrier de France in 2000, a prestigious title for outstanding French craftsmanship. Maison Mons has an selection of over 200 different cheeses, which they export to cheese lovers all over the world. The company is famous for its quality and knowledge of cheese, a result of the tradition of two generations.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51RpNP-9XmL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BOSKA","source_asin":"B075D2S53W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-966095","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075D2S53W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075D2S53W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
