window.products.push({"id":966104,"name":"Hand Forged Wolf Jaw Blacksmith Tongs, 16\" L","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41eiz9nrYIL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Tongs are a type of Blacksmith’s tools which used to grip hold and lift forging hot piece of metal instead of holding them directly with hand without burning. It is made from spring steel metal (Grade - 5160) and are superior to pliers or vise grips for holding hot metal because tongs have large flat smooth jaw surfaces that do not scratch the work piece There are many form tongs adopted to their specific use, the most common types being flat jaw tong, wolf jaw tong, mandrel jaw tong, round jaw tong, flat jaw tong with v groove, flat jaw tong with square groove. specialty tongs are designed and forged by the individual blacksmith to hold any other special shapes of hot metal that are commonly handled by that particular smith. 16-inches long tongs which are a great size for general work in a coal or gas forge for blacksmith. Specifications Type: Wolf Jaw Tong Type: Wolf Jaw Tong Metal Grade: 5160 Spring steel Metal Metal Grade: 5160 Spring steel Metal Overall Length: 16 inch Overall Length: 16 inch Rivet Center to Jaw Length: 3 inch Rivet Center to Jaw Length: 3 inch Jaw Length: 2.25 inch Jaw Length: 2.25 inch Reigns Length: 13 inch Reigns Length: 13 inch Application: Hold metal round, square, flat 6mm to 20mm stock Application: Hold metal round, square, flat 6mm to 20mm stock Note: Product is painted with Black color. It is mainly for the corrosion resistance and it will not affect any functional performance.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41eiz9nrYIL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SIMOND STORE","source_asin":"B07NRT3W5N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-966104","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07NRT3W5N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07NRT3W5N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":966105,"name":"Pearl Mantels 415-72-50 Abingdon Wood 72-Inch Fireplace Mantel Shelf, Medium Distressed Oak","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51bxRW+hjzL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"From the Manufacturer It’s the first piece of furniture in any home. There's nothing as warm and welcoming as a crackling fire in an open fireplace. The dancing flames can lift your spirits and melt away the most stressful day in a matter of minutes. But to truly be part of the home, a fireplace must warm our hearts even when there is no fire in the grate. Pearl does not treat the mantel as trim or molding but as a beautiful piece of furniture that is the focal point of the entire room, the emotional core. It represents roots, heritage and tradition. Furniture is arranged around it, precious treasures are displayed on it, and it provides balance and stability to the entire room. Pearl Mantels features fine furniture quality, stunning details and classic designs that will enhance any decor. The Abingdon features a hidden center drawer that is designed to subtly blend between the shelf's corbels offering a secret storage compartment for the remote control or treasured keepsakes. Rich distressed medium finish. Hand crafted from durable Asian hardwoods and veneers. Mitered hanger board assembly included for easy installation. Top Shelf Length: 72\" Bottom Base Length: 69\" Top Shelf Depth: 10\" Bottom Base Depth: 8\" Distance between Corbels: 48\" Width of each Corbel: 5\" Overall Height without Corbels: 5 1/4\" Overall Height: 10\" Drawer Length: 47 3/4\" Drawer Depth x Height: 6 1/4\"x2 1/2\" Weight 49 pounds. Look for the pearl inlay that graces the right hand side of the shelf as proof that you have received an authentic Pearl Mantel. Also available unfinished - paint and stain grade.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51bxRW+hjzL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pearl Mantels","source_asin":"B002OSX2Z6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-966105","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002OSX2Z6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B002OSX2Z6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
