window.products.push({"id":966187,"name":"Twine Chateau Treasure Chest Wine Box, 1 Bottle, Maroon","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Wt6VU4s5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Wine accessories of all shapes and sizes can be used to make a grand statement to those who enter your home, and if you’re a real wine lover, there’s no better way to show off your passion. While it’s clear that this decorative box is designed to hold the finest, most well-loved bottles of wine you own, it’s also discreet, and will blend in flawlessly with the décor in your home. The traditional metal, faux leather and bronze materials embrace the rustic and traditional decorative styles, and add a touch of class to any room in which it’s put on display. The materials also give these decorative storage boxes a distinctly nautical feel that simply can’t be ignored. The warm wood color makes the accessory more welcoming than others of a similar variety, and is bound to draw the eye of visiting friends and family. Its style is only matched by the box’s unbeatable sturdiness. Regardless of how precious the bottle of wine you’re looking to store is, you can trust this box to get the job done while looking amazing and boosting the décor of your home. Furthermore, this single-storage solution allows you to simplify the organization of an existing wine collection. If you have a single bottle that’s more special than all the rest, store it in this richly-colored wooden chest like the treasure it is, and never spend too much time trying to hunt it down. The dark, cool interior also serves as an excellent way to preserve your wine while it ages.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Wt6VU4s5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Twine","source_asin":"B097V4RRXG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-966187","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097V4RRXG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097V4RRXG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
