window.products.push({"id":966208,"name":"TastLi Portable Blender, USB Rechargeable Personal Juice to Go Fruit Juicer Cup Mini Blender for Shakes and Smoothies (Pink purple)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711pGwVEDbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"TastLi--Taste a Healthy Life. Leading fashion, sunshine and Healthy lifestyle. Specification: Max. power: 175W Motor: 22000 rpm±15% 7.4V Blade material: 304 Stainless Steel, 6 Blades in 3D Material: food grade PCTG & ABS, BPA free Temperature: Below 50℃/120℉ Capacity: 380ml/14oz Cup Product Dimensions: 3.2x3.2x9\"Product Weight: 1.2 lb Package included: 1 x Electric fruit juicer cup 1 x Micro USB Charging Cable 1 x User Manual When you get your Product, please pay attention to the following tips: 1.Don't put your hands inside your blender or try to touch the blades. 2.Don't use your blender when charging or run your blender without anything inside. 3.Don't recommend hot liquids over 50 degree which will be easy cause damage or leakage. 4.Charge your blender for 2 or 3 hours before your first use. The lights turns red while charging and blue once full charged. 5.Cut the fruits into 1.5*1.5CM or small thin pieces, remove the cores, hard thick fruit skin or hard shell. 6. Add water or milk and put appropriate amount of fruit slices into the juicer, Double-click the switch button to start. 7.It is a normal phenomenon that juicer stop working. You can restart it. To get the best result, we advise you to shake the juicer during operating. 8.Red and blue flashing lights mean your jar isn't aligned with your base. To fix this, the arrow on the jar should line up with the switch on the base. 9.Red flashing lights mean your blender needs to be recharged or that your blades are blocked. Recharge or shake your blender.10.You can blend ice. Make sure your blender with sufficient liquid inside first, and that your cubes aren’t too large.11.There might be a little color difference due to the monitor, camera or other factors, please refer to the physical item.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711pGwVEDbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TastLi","source_asin":"B08SQ7RGTF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-966208","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08SQ7RGTF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08SQ7RGTF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
