window.products.push({"id":966392,"name":"Air Fryer Toaster Oven Combo - Fabuletta 10-in-1 Countertop Convection Oven 1800W, Flip Up & Away Capability for Storage Space, Oil-Less Air Fryer Ove","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":129.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61aATG4miVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍩10 PRESET FUNCTIONS: This versatile Fabuletta air fryer oven is programmed with 10 preset cooking functions, preheat, air fry, pizza, air roast, toast, bagel, bake, broil, dehydrate, reheat. Guiding and giving you plenty of ways to make easy and delicious meals and snacks. 🍩360° RAPID HEAT CIRCULATION AIR FRY TECHNOLOGY: Compared to the traditional oven, our air fryer toaster oven adopts 360° rapid heat circulation Air Fry Technology, which requires up to 85% less oil than traditional deep frying while maintaining the same crispy textures, making it ideal for air frying chicken, French fries, steak, fish and more. 🍩FAST & EVEN COOKING: With 1800W power and 4 heating elements, our convection oven cooks up to 50% faster than a traditional oven, PREHEAT twice as fast as other ovens. Excellent TOAST function designed with 9 slices of bread to a golden level in less than 4 mins. This toaster oven delivers faster and more even cooking performance for you. 🍩LARGE CAPACITY & SPACE SAVER: This toaster ovens countertop is big enough for up to 9 slices bread, 12” pizza. 2 rack positions for improved cooking flexibility and accommodating a variety of foods. Spacious interior, compact form factor without taking up too much counter space. Takes up 50% less space when you flip it up and away to store against your kitchen backsplash. 🍩7 TOAST SHADE SETTINGS: Choosing from lightly golden to deep dark toasted slice from 1(light) to 7(dark) gear accommodated by individual preferences.For the first use, it is recommended to select a medium browning level (example: 3 or 4),if you would like to add butter or cheese,please add it after baking. And we will provide a 24-month warranty and lifetime customer service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61aATG4miVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FABULETTA","source_asin":"B0C8CXZ95S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-966392","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C8CXZ95S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C8CXZ95S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
