window.products.push({"id":966485,"name":"Full Mattress in a Box, 8 inch Mattresses for Platform Bed Double Size Daybed Bunk, Memory Foam Medium Firm","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":240.19,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IZqhFmZiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Unparalleled Quality Control - you can rest easy knowing your new mattress was created with high manufacturing standards and environmentally conscious practices. Get a good night's sleep every single night and wake up feeling refreshed and ready for the day. Medium-Firm Feel - medium-firm is supportive for most body types and sleep positions. Too-soft mattresses don’t give proper support and can cause back problems in the long run. Too-hard mattresses don’t provide pressure point relief. The sweet point is our medium-firm (6-7 out of 10 on the firmness level scale) mattress strikes the right balance between comfort and support and promotes better sleep. Gel Infused - our foam is infused with a cooling gel that helps in dissipating heat, allowing you to sleep cool while retaining memory foam’s original body-conforming and pressure-relieving features. CertiPUR-US Certified - all foam used in our mattresses are made without ozone depleters and maintain CertiPUR-US Safety Standards of textile articles at all stages of production. It will have minimal off-gassing, or “new mattress” smell when brought into your home. Fiberglass-Free FR Inner Cover - the rib fabric, 92% Cotton, 8% Polyester, provides a safe, effective flame retardant layer around our mattresses, without the negative aspects of fiberglass and other fire-retardant chemicals. No skin irritation, no breathing problems, and no health risks for you and your family — so you can truly rest easy at night. Ready for Instant Enjoyment - compressed into one box that is easily shipped and maneuvered into the bedroom. Simply unbox, unroll and this mattress does the rest, expanding to its original shape within 2 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IZqhFmZiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MLILY","source_asin":"B09SXQ54RR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-966485","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09SXQ54RR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09SXQ54RR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":966486,"name":"Uniflasy 26.8\" Gas Fireplace Log Set, Ceramic White Birch for Intdoor Inserts, Vented, Propane, Electric Gas Fireplaces, Outdoor, Linear Fire Pits Cer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Byiu-7O3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Dimension】- 6 Large White Birch Ceramic Gas Log Set Including 6 logs: each log is approximately 18.9-26.7 inches long x 4.52 to 5.9 inches in diameter. --Fits for your all type fireplace or fire pit. ➤If you have any questions about the goods you have received, please contact us and we will try our best to help you solve them 【Wide Used】Fit for All Type of Fireplace Or Fire Pit- Uniflasy Gas Fireplace Logs Set, Ceramic White Birch Wood are perfect for ventless gas fireplace, vented gas fireplace, Outdoor & indoor gas fireplaces, direct vent, zero clearance, natural gas, gel fireplaces, standard fire pits, fake fireplaces, ethanol fireplaces, electric fireplace inserts, vent free fireplaces, propane fireplaces, etc 【Ideal Choice】 --Superior Refractory Ceramics fiber, can withstand the most extreme temperatures without damage --Reusable, No unpleasant smell, NO toxic fumes, soot or ash --No need to sweep out your fireplace, cut and stack wood, maintain and sweep the chimney, paying for firewood each year any more. --You could enjoy your fiireplace when it have fire during social gathering. You will not be interrupted every thirty minutes or so to go monitor the fire constantly 【Wonderful and Decorative】 Realistic gas logs, natural appearance. After burning on a gas fireplace for about 10 to 20 minutes, the logs are fully warmed up and it really looks like a real campfire burning, you will catch the logs glow form a beautiful orange on the bottom and turn. They are good decorations. Add a modern look to your fireplace/fire pit. Your better choice for fireplace centerpiece! ➤Can be used byitself, and also could be used with fireglass, to creat wonderful fire flame 【Keep Clean Burning】 ➤Leave 2 inches (5 centimeters) between logs.Make sure none of the logs is blocking the gas flow. ➤If you find that a log is blocking it, you will have to re-arrange the logs.➤Do not use with real burning logs, real logs will release ash 【Complement Piece】 ➤Can be used to complement current gas logs, crackle flame fire logs, fire starters, fire log, crackle flame fire logs, fire starters, glowing embers, and lava rocks","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Byiu-7O3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Uniflasy","source_asin":"B09JGPML2B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-966486","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JGPML2B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JGPML2B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
