window.products.push({"id":966546,"name":"UBING 18x 18 Black White Buffalo Check Plaid Christmas Decorative Farmhouse Throw Pillow Covers for Home Patio Decor Rustic Pillowcase for Sofa Couch ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810T4G4J8yL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Bend Linen 【Accurate Dimension】Standard 18 x 18 inch (45 x 45cm) Christmas pillow covers. Please allow 1-2 cm deviation due to manual cutting and sewing. Note: One sided-printing, the pillow insert is NOT included. 【Comfortable & Quality Material】These buffalo plaid winter Christmas pillowcases are made of quality polyester linen, strict process control and material quality control ensure to keep the natural texture and durability. Giving you comfortable touch and cozy feelings in the winter season. 【Useful Anywhere】These Christmas style throw pillow covers is suitable for living room, sofa, car, bedroom. perfect as home decorations and daily supplies. also ideal as a gift to your family, friends and coworkers. 【Attractive Design】Our Christmas pillow cover featured a vivid & non-fading pattern, advanced printing, no bending, fading or fraying issue. Both hand wash and machine wash are available (Highly recommend cold water or warm water that temperature low than 40℃/104℉). 【Great for Christmas Decor】These 18x 18 inch winter Christmas pillow covers are a great addition for winter and Christmas holiday decoration. Classic and trendy with buffalo plaid and farmhouse quote design, which add rustic and holiday atmosphere instantly. Perfect farmhouse rustic decor for your porch bench, entryway, living room and etc. It also can be a great housewarming or holiday gifts for your family and friends.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810T4G4J8yL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"UBING","source_asin":"B09FZ7SCGY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-966546","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09FZ7SCGY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09FZ7SCGY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":966547,"name":"pentaQ Cake Carrier Cake Holder Carrier with Handle Cake Transporter 10 Inch Cake and Cupcake Muffin Carrier Holder with Cake Boards, Cake Knife and C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ovKtfHP+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Are you looking for a multifunctional cake carrier that carries both 9 inch standard size cake and cupcakes, now we design this for you. Components of the cake carrier: Elegantly Designed Cover with Collapsible Handle In order to make it easy for you to share your cakes with your friends and family we put the collapsible handle on the top of the cover, so you can easily take your cake everywhere you want. When you don’t need to use the handle you can just press the handle down. Multifunctional Non-slip Base with Durable Locks The locks seal airtight to keep your goodies fresh. The base can be flipped over and used as a serving tray with five sections. With the non-slip base, your cake won’t easily slide to the other side if the cake carrier is tilted during the transportation. Removable cupcake stand： When you need to take some cupcakes to share, the cupcake stand comes in handy, the removable cupcake stand allows you to take 11 cupcakes per time, when you don’t need to use it you just take it off the base. What is included in the gift package： 1. Thickened cake board ×72. Stainless cake cutter×13. Polished cake forks × 5 About PentaQ We are a company that designs, manufactures and sells kitchen appliances. In order to let you enjoy your cooking process and save your time, we have made a lot of efforts to design more useful products and improve the quality of our products. We will also provide you with more high-quality products in the future. If you encounter any questions about our products, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ovKtfHP+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"pentaQ","source_asin":"B08FQVG16X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-966547","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FQVG16X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FQVG16X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
