window.products.push({"id":966624,"name":"jinchan French Door Curtain for Door Winow Paisley Scroll Printed Linen Glass Door Curtain 72 inch Long Door Panel Rod Pocket Light Filtering Door Dra","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rcPn72PqS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ready Made: Package includes 1 panel of linen door curtain with matching tieback, each panel measuring 50\"W x 72\"L. Each panel has 1.5 inch high pole pocket, which works well with tension rods or normal rods, easy to install and slide. It is recommended to use rod less than 1 inch in diameter. Timeless Design: The linen-textured door panel adds soft dimension to windows for a space that feels rustic yet complete. Elaborate scroll paisley print creates a sense of freshness and elegance, adding a natural and peaceful ambiance to your room. Light Filtering: Our floral door curtain beautifully frame your window with a soft and hazy vision. Softly filtering out harsh sunlight, let the breeze flow through your window and offers just the right amount of privacy. Adjustable Tieback: 23\" snap button tie-back with 2 fitting options to softly filters light in, get just the right amount of sunlight according to needs. Looks better when pulled as taut as possible both inside and outside. The sashe with nice touch does a great job of bundling the curtain up if you want to let some light in. Easy Care: The durability of our french door curtain is due to the sturdy linen-poly blend fabric and top-notch sewing quality. The curtain is machine washable in cold water and tumble dry in a low setting. Do not bleach. Creases on the linen curtain from packing and shipping can be pressed out with low temperature ironing.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rcPn72PqS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"jinchan","source_asin":"B08Q3B4N9L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-966624","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Q3B4N9L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Q3B4N9L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":966625,"name":"Ner Mitzvah White Chanukah Candles - Standard Size Fits Most Menorahs - Premium Quality Wax - 44 Count for All 8 Nights of Hanukkah.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":4.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VXo3lCJEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"LIGHT UP THE NIGHT A favorite for so many, celebrating Chanuka is a highlight of the year. Of all the holiday traditions, kindling the Menorah is the main event. Lighting the candles while reciting the blessings and singing traditional hymns brings family and friends together to celebrate, young and old alike. Ner Mitzvah’s variety of Chanukah candles allows you to choose a size, color and design that you love to celebrate the holiday in style. Whether you prefer a classic, standard size white, natural beeswax, fun multi-color assortments or funky themes, we have the perfect candles to put the finishing touches on your menora and make it look spectacular. Celebrate the Festival of Lights with plenty of candles to last you through all 8 nights, just like the miraculous oil jug in the Holy Temple. Our 44-count boxes suffice to light one menorah, including the shamash, on each night of the chag. PRODUCT FEATURES: - Kosher & Meets All Halachic Requirements - 3.5\" (90 mm) - Stays Lit At Least 30 Minutes - Premium Quality Wax - 5/16” (8 mm) Standard Size Fits Most Menorahs - White - Choose from 1-pack or 2-pack - 44 Count per Box CUSTOMIZE YOUR CANDLES Kindle the perfect Chanuka candles to complement your chanukiya & create a dazzling display! Choose from Ner Mitzvahs full line of: - Short 4” or Long 9” - Multicolored, Classic, Metallic, Pastel or Natural - Straight & Smooth, Spiral, Wavy, Criss-Cross - Beeswax or Honeycomb - Dreidel or “Happy Chanukah” Art ABOUT NER MITZVAH Family-operated since the 1940’s, Ner Mitzvah is an expert candle-maker, delivering a wide selection of products at the highest quality with personal customer service. Count on us for Shabbat, Havdalah, and Chanukah candles and oil lamps as well as related Judaica.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VXo3lCJEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ner Mitzvah","source_asin":"B081TQ119B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-966625","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B081TQ119B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B081TQ119B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
