window.products.push({"id":966676,"name":"Window Film One Way Mirror Film Privacy Mirror Adhesive Residential DIY Window Film Heat Control Glare Control Anti UV Window Tint for Home and Office","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61w6hNuOSuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Privacy Window Film One Way Mirror Film 35” x 78.7” The product can effectively protect your privacy against glare, heat and UV radiation or breakage.. It can not be used directly as a mirror. If you are on the same side where strong light source, it looks like a mirror, in contrast, you can look through. Specification: Light transmission: 20% Degree of heat insulation:85% UV-blocking: 99% Notice: For single or double glazing we recommend to glue them inside because there are uncontrollable factors outside. If the glass is solar control glass, heat glass, gas-filled panes or other special glass, it is better to stick outside because the heat is shut off by reflection. If the glass itself absorbs heat too well and is still stuck inside, it will cause high temperature. (It will never burst, even if the temperature is high) If there are some small bubbles you couldn’t remove,don’t worry the bubbles will be less over time  Tip for Removing the Carrier Film: Place two pieces of tape on two sides and then remove slowly. Installation: 1. Trim films to required size. 2. Clean glass 3. Wet glass with soapy water 4. Peel off backing film 5. Set up film on glass 6. Squeegee away water and air bubbles 7. Cut off margins Included 1x Roll 35” x 78.7” Window Film Customer Service: If you have questions and problems, please contact us!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61w6hNuOSuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OUBAY","source_asin":"B07HR8P2TX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-966676","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HR8P2TX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HR8P2TX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
