window.products.push({"id":966749,"name":"Chef Grade, Extra Strong 8 Inch French Coil Whisk. Best Metal Galaxy Kitchen Whisks for Mixing Thick Gravy. Perfect Stainless Steel Spiral Hand Whip f","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dWVtBgkhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Whisk up the best desserts ever with our super strong, super powerful French whisk that's loved by chefs the world over! Our large 8\" galaxy whisks are the best alternative to balloon whisks - whipping up eggs, gravies, batters and custards with ease and speed. It's the best kitchen tool for both commercial cooks and home bakers. Super durable and endlessly reusable Don't worry about cheap tools that break in weeks or months. Our manual spring stirrer is built to last, so you don't have to keep buying replacements. The circular shape of our whisker means no long wires that break and bend when faced with thick liquids. Plus, it's 100% dishwasher safe to save you cleaning time! Makes a great gift for home cooks It's a must-have for your favorite baker's collection of kitchen supplies and accessories! Your friend or loved one will love the professional quality and super comfortable handle of our scrambler tools. The round shape and coil mean more surface area makes contact with the liquid than a standard balloon whisk, making it a much better option. Whisk up anything you can think of - our mixer is up to the task! Our long coiled whisk is the ultimate accessory for any mixing, scrambling or stirring you need done quickly. The round end makes quick work of any omelette, scrambled eggs, whipped cream, custard, pancake or crepe batter, gourmet sauce, salad dressing, breakfast hollandaise or gravy What’s in the box? One (1) handheld mechanical French coil whisk made of high quality stainless steel. Each whisk is 8 inches long total. The handle is 7 inches long with a 1 inch coil mixer on the end. The width of the coil is 1.75 inches. Lifetime 100% money-back satisfaction guarantee! If you aren’t completely satisfied with your order, simply email us, and we will respond within 24 hours to make it right even on the weekends. We absolutely guarantee your satisfaction or your money back!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dWVtBgkhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Avant Grub","source_asin":"B087GHVMV5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-966749","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B087GHVMV5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B087GHVMV5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
