window.products.push({"id":966793,"name":"AUZONA Travel Neck Pillow,100% Pure Memory Foam Pillow with Eye Masks, Earplugs, and Luxury Bag ,Machine Washable Cover,Skin-Friendly&Breathable Pillo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71l5N5Baa7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Super soft skin-friendly fluff material] The pillowcase is made of super soft texture plush, soft and delicate, without pilling, skin-friendly touch, giving your skin gentle care, suitable for adult use. Equipped with a hidden zipper, it is easier to remove the pillowcase for cleaning. [High-quality memory foam] Our pillows use the highest quality memory foam, which can best support the head and neck. After continuous and careful testing of a variety of different hardnesses, the most suitable hardness was selected, which will not cause discomfort and pressure on the head and neck while having sufficient support. [Comfortable and ergonomic design] The pillow is designed according to ergonomics and uses 3D to support your head and care for your cervical spine. The contoured shape at side avoids the discomfort of squeezing feeling for ears and leaves proper space for headphones; The flat-cut at pillow back could perfectly fit seat back and prevent the head from being pushed forward; The buckle can be used to adjust the size that best suits you; Every detail is designed for your travel comfort! [Neck comfort everwhere] This travel pillow is not only suitable for long-distance travel, you may also need it in your daily life. When you are working in the office, driving a car, or reading books at home, you can use this neck pillow to relieve your neck pressure, thereby reducing your fatigue, which will greatly improve your quality of life. You can also give this Auzona neck travel pillow to your relatives and friends, It's a gift you can give someone that will last forever. [Space-saving travel companion] The compressed size of the product is 7.9L, 7W inches, and the weight is 0.7 pounds. Auzona’s travel neck pillows are designed for light weight, portability and comfort. As long as the product is compressed into the size of Swiss roll, and after lightly pressing it into the storage bag, it is only 1/2 the size of the original product, which greatly saves space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71l5N5Baa7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AUZONA","source_asin":"B09KBCTDMB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-966793","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09KBCTDMB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09KBCTDMB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
