window.products.push({"id":966991,"name":"Bedsure Weighted Blanket 15 lbs with Removable Duvet Cover (60×80 inches, Queen Size, Grey) - for 130lbs-160lbs Individual - 100% Microfiber Heavy Bla","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ufxEdaJXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Sleep Faster And Better:Bedsure Weighted Blanket is designed to give a gentle pressure across your body that feels like a warm hug all over and helps you sleep better - When you feel restless and lay the blanket on you, this 15lbs heavy blanket delivers the comforting weight (a secure, cozy warmth feeling) and calms you down to fall asleep faster. Complete Set! Duvet Cover Included:Complete set includes a weighted blanket and a removable duvet cover for easy washing (no more wash the heavy blanket frequently) - A custom sized blanket cover has corresponding ties to attach to loops on the blanket to keep cover in place - Reversible design of cool cotton on one side and soft fleece on the other for versatile use. Choose The Right Size & Weight: Choose a weighted blanket that occupies about 7-12% of your body weight and 15lbs blanket is suitable for 130lbs-160lbs individual (contact us if you are not sure) - A weighted blanket is usually smaller than your ordinary blanket of the same size, which could help to concentrate the weight on your body. Engineered For You: Smaller glass beads sewn between two layers of poly-fill batting keep quiet when moved around unlike bulky plastic pellets - Exquisite quilting keeps glass beads more evenly distributed across the entire blanket and won¡¯t leak out - Perfect choice for someone who needs comfort and sense of security in any occasion. Dedicated Customer Service: Available in Bedsure Weighted Blanket with Removable Cover, Queen Size (15lbs, 60\"¡Á80\", Gray/White) - Veritable Bedsure Trademarked Products - In Business Since 1979 - Bedsure strives to provide 1-Month return and replacement service & life-time free customer service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ufxEdaJXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BEDSURE","source_asin":"B07WVTKX7S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-966991","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WVTKX7S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WVTKX7S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
